[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=Vanta
GenericName=Game Launcher
Comment=Launch and organise your Linux and Windows game library
Comment[de]=Linux- und Windows-Spielbibliothek verwalten und starten
Comment[es]=Organiza y ejecuta tu biblioteca de juegos de Linux y Windows
Comment[fr]=Organisez et lancez votre bibliothèque de jeux Linux et Windows
Comment[pt_BR]=Organize e inicie sua biblioteca de jogos Linux e Windows
Exec=vanta %F
Icon=vanta
Terminal=false
Categories=Game;
Keywords=game;launcher;wine;proton;steam;library;
StartupNotify=true
StartupWMClass=vanta
